{"4744260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sprawl Life", "steam_appid": 4744260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5033310], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR CYBERPUNK LIFE, YOUR WAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start your adventure doing odd jobs like deliveries and bartending, meeting friends and growing your wealth!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744260/extras/4b2f4248b96cbe6f9a85e74120a8d29b.avif?t=1786038529\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744260/extras_big/4b2f4248b96cbe6f9a85e74120a8d29b.avif?t=1786038529 width=1560 height=478 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2D OPEN WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each district in Sprawl Life is procedurally generated, no district is ever the same. The cast of NPCs are also procedural, angry street vendors, innocent laborers, spawn a different name, role and voice every time. With our robust story system, robots sound like robots, and crime lords sound like crime lords.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLE CAREER PATHS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a medic, bartender, infiltrator, hacker... The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744260/extras/536bd136a8e2465d40e37f1a717ce7c5.avif?t=1786038529\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744260/extras_big/536bd136a8e2465d40e37f1a717ce7c5.avif?t=1786038529 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RUN MISSIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From deliveries to combat missions, hack major corporations, and explore enemy hideouts. Grow your rep, faction standing, and favors to grow in power and influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744260/extras/c6f0638a8f700892906e44ed3cfa67ab.avif?t=1786038529\" width=1420 height=394 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR OPERATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase real estate like vending machines and nightclubs, hire NPCs to work them and earn credits passively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are just a few of the things you can expect in Sprawl Life - your futuristic life simulator!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR CYBERPUNK LIFE, YOUR WAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start your adventure doing odd jobs like deliveries and bartending, meeting friends and growing your wealth!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744260/extras/4b2f4248b96cbe6f9a85e74120a8d29b.avif?t=1786038529\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744260/extras_big/4b2f4248b96cbe6f9a85e74120a8d29b.avif?t=1786038529 width=1560 height=478 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2D OPEN WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each district in Sprawl Life is procedurally generated, no district is ever the same. The cast of NPCs are also procedural, angry street vendors, innocent laborers, spawn a different name, role and voice every time. With our robust story system, robots sound like robots, and crime lords sound like crime lords.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLE CAREER PATHS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a medic, bartender, infiltrator, hacker... The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744260/extras/536bd136a8e2465d40e37f1a717ce7c5.avif?t=1786038529\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744260/extras_big/536bd136a8e2465d40e37f1a717ce7c5.avif?t=1786038529 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RUN MISSIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From deliveries to combat missions, hack major corporations, and explore enemy hideouts. Grow your rep, faction standing, and favors to grow in power and influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744260/extras/c6f0638a8f700892906e44ed3cfa67ab.avif?t=1786038529\" width=1420 height=394 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR OPERATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase real estate like vending machines and nightclubs, hire NPCs to work them and earn credits passively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are just a few of the things you can expect in Sprawl Life - your futuristic life simulator!</p>", "short_description": "A 2D open world cyberpunk life sim, rise from the slums doing odd jobs, and become the faction leader in a towering dystopia. Hack accounts, own real estate from vending machines to nightclubs, fight enforcers, and keep upgrading your gear and operations. Or just serve bar drinks. Your choice.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744260/ae2ee5b4e30e08327972643296e087bc6fac8c0b/header.jpg?t=1786038529", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744260/45014cb804977a239dc6de7ab29d9cd1d131aa12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786038529", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744260/45014cb804977a239dc6de7ab29d9cd1d131aa12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786038529", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti / AMD Radeon RX 570 (4GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible sound card</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700K / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 / AMD RX 6700 XT or higher (6GB+ VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible sound card</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Hologram Nation"], "publishers": ["Hologram Nation"], "demos": [{"appid": 5033310, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 78, "description": "Adjustable Difficulty"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744260/227cce6a2dfbdd1a93d516167fa85ca367dee9c8/ss_227cce